        <source>Text, translation and commentary from Janice F. Baca, 'The Cochin Hebrew Book of Matthew' (Project Truth Ministries, 2025–2026), published a chapter at a time.</source>
        <source>Codicology and provenance from the Cambridge University Library catalogue record for MS Oo.1.32.</source>
